{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/d3618d96938b20ff6175d4c6032253b1.poster.avif?t=1769184487\" width=614 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/d3618d96938b20ff6175d4c6032253b1.webm?t=1769184487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up for an adrenaline-fuelled 1980s British bank heist. Play as an ex-SAS miner turned outlaw in a third-person destructible cover shooter. Shoot sneak &amp; smash through punks skinheads &amp; bent coppers then escape through London Master lockpicking safe-cracking &amp; hacking as you plan for the BIG JOB. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/14613f565903af061b35e7e883ef10be.poster.avif?t=1769184487\" width=614 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/14613f565903af061b35e7e883ef10be.webm?t=1769184487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exciting third person cover shooter.\u00a0 With destructible cover, elements of stealth, action and problem solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/b21a6a14f20dcda224e8198f8da621ad.poster.avif?t=1769184487\" width=614 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/b21a6a14f20dcda224e8198f8da621ad.webm?t=1769184487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locations based in a dystopian 1980's Britain. With real life myths and history that play into the plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/6b1af80c1105754fd76e010da9bc0ab6.poster.avif?t=1769184487\" width=614 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/6b1af80c1105754fd76e010da9bc0ab6.webm?t=1769184487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Darkly satirical humour. With a controversial political undertone, set in a British bank heist game.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/c6ca8ac0ccec7c0d8349eb5d6736f754.poster.avif?t=1769184487\" width=614 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/c6ca8ac0ccec7c0d8349eb5d6736f754.webm?t=1769184487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse and unforgettable enemies that you will love to hate. Based on 80's subcultures, like the Punks (the Blacklegs), Skinheads (the Scabs), crooked Coppers (the Knobsticks) and a corrupt fascist regime. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/e907e728e97fd50ee8ec604c569d21ba.poster.avif?t=1769184487\" width=614 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/e907e728e97fd50ee8ec604c569d21ba.webm?t=1769184487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Large array of popular 80's weapons. Available to add to your arsenal as you plan for the BIG JOB. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/8571f3b449e989d934b7ea951255de2a.poster.avif?t=1769184487\" width=614 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/8571f3b449e989d934b7ea951255de2a.webm?t=1769184487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A range of skills to learn and develop. Throughout the story, such as safe-cracking, lock-picking and computer hacking.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2456870?t=1769184487","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769184487","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/29578692b776114a44084ee55b213b25543605ac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769184487","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/29578692b776114a44084ee55b213b25543605ac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769184487","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/d3618d96938b20ff6175d4c6032253b1.poster.avif?t=1769184487\" wid